			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Update Grove.proto field names to PascalCase\n\nConvert all protobuf message field names from snake_case to PascalCase to align with the project's naming conventions as specified in CLAUDE.md.\n\nKey changes:\n- Package name: `grove.v1` → `Grove`\n- All message fields: `extension_id` → `ExtensionId`, `display_name` → `DisplayName`, `activation_events` → `ActivationEvents`, etc.\n- Added explicit `syntax = \"proto3\";` declaration\n\nAlso apply minor formatting consistency: comment style fixes in vscode.rs and CommonAdapter.rs, import consolidation in build.rs, and whitespace normalization in extension_loading_test.rs.\n\nThis is a breaking change to the gRPC protocol - consumers of the GroveService will need to update their field references.",
			"SHA": "8eeb25ebbc3153c797558a9cd3b77ef57e70c1c8"
		},
